 Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Reports to:&nbsp;</strong>School Athletic Director</span></p><p><span style="color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Deadline for application:&nbsp;</strong></span><span style="background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;">Applications will be reviewed on or after 10/20/2026</span></p><p><span style="color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>EDUCATION/EXPERIENCE</strong></span><br><span style="color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Required:</strong></span><br><span style="color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">High School Diploma/GED</span><br><span style="color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; CPR certification</span><br><span style="color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; CHSAA test and regulation</span><br><span style="color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Concussion Education</span><br><span style="color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Prior coaching experience in this sport</span><br><br><span style="color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Preferred:</strong></span><br><span style="color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">&nbsp;Bilingual skills</span><br><span style="color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other combination of related education, experience and training</span><br>&nbsp;</p><p><span style="color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>JOB DESCRIPTION</strong></span></p><p><span st