trong>EDUCATION/EXPERIENCE:</strong></span><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Required:</strong></span><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">High School Diploma/GED</span><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; CPR certification</span><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; CHSAA test and regulation</span><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Concussion Education</span><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Prior coaching experience in this sport</span><br><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Preferred:</strong></span><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">Bilingual skills</span><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Any other combination of related education, experience and training</span><br>&nbsp;</p><p><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>JOB DESCRIPTION</strong></span></p><p><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Summary/Objective:&nbsp;</strong>Responsible for all aspects of head coach; overseeing assistant coaches;&nbsp;making decisions based on the direction of the program.</span><br><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Essential Functions:&nbsp;</strong>Organizing and supervising game help.&nbsp; Assists with supervision at activities.</span><br><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Additional Qualifications:&nbsp;</strong>Applicant&nbsp;must complete concussion training.</span><br><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><strong>Other Duties:</strong></span><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;"><i>Knowledge, Skills, and Mental Ability</i></span></p><ul><li class="ck-list-marker-font-size ck-list-marker-font-family" style="--ck-content-list-marker-font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:12px;" data-list-item-id="ecea6effe01d1c1b4658c28056e577fa7"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">Knowledge of Colorado and district content standards.</span></li><li class="ck-list-marker-font-size ck-list-marker-font-family" style="--ck-content-list-marker-font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:12px;" data-list-item-id="e9d5548de58e4bb59c680e223c879392c"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">Knowledge and skills sufficient to perform all duties of the position.</span></li><li class="ck-list-marker-font-size ck-list-marker-font-family" style="--ck-content-list-marker-font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:12px;" data-list-item-id="e8a40641abffc0ba309b91ab903491f3a"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">Prefers leadership situations relating to meeting the social, emotional, psychological and academic needs of students.</span></li><li class="ck-list-marker-font-size ck-list-marker-font-family" style="--ck-content-list-marker-font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:12px;" data-list-item-id="e3e38b98ecd22d0b8000cf821fa82c2d9"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">Prefers a work environment where flexibility, ability to deal with conflict, a high tolerance for stress, an ability to quickly internalize information and make informed decisions, and long hours are a part of the assignment.</span></li></ul><p><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;">Please note t